{"hw":"αὐτοσχεδιάζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">αὐτοσχεδιάζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">αὐτοσχεδι-άζω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ασθείς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Stratt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> </span>: (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">αὐτοσχέδιος</span>):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">act</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">speak offhand, extemporize,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">413d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mx.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">235c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.5.21</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> c. acc., <b class=\"lex-tr\">extemporize,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὰ δέοντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.138</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.2.32</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> mostly in bad sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">act, speak,</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">think unadvisedly,</b> <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Euthd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">278e</span> </span>;